## ⚡ Framework & Development Conventions

### 1. Tailwind CSS v4 Utility Rules
- This project leverages **Tailwind CSS v4** coupled with `@tailwindcss/vite`.
- Styling must follow the premium, medical emerald theme:
  - Base theme: Emerald shades (`text-emerald-900`, `bg-emerald-950`, `bg-emerald-50`, `border-emerald-200`).
  - Highlight Accent: Gold/Yellow shade (`bg-yellow-400`, `text-emerald-950`).
- Use the `cn(...)` utility inside `dialysis/src/lib/utils.ts` for styling conditional variables.

### 2. PDF coordinates (`pdf-lib`)
- Keep coordinate references mapped exactly within standard bounds.
- Use `PdfLayoutDebugger.tsx` for validating coordinates before committing modifications in `exportPddPdf.ts`.

### 3. Component & State Discipline
- Ensure state routing in `App.tsx` corresponds to client tabs.
- Always match form changes with `types.ts` structures. No `any` TS types allowed.
- Wrap dynamic portal components with `<motion.div>` from `motion/react` to preserve responsive transitions.

